{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c669982643bb1a1877fe18ae9edea54d8546ab57a57bda3789bd1d5fe9f5358",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5aa5446ce756e5b191a2bfa6153eab0e5d2b0cb9731b9503e59fa9ecaa1011a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n今天一整天辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2cddc6c6c75750bb3281d82d799c7eb4d2269da43307b368683fbc5c53a043d",
      "text": "抱歉啊，瞒着你特别舞台的事。\n但是，无论如何都想给你个惊喜嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000010:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d2d8bd60ae1c57b5cc3540026b2d1040a4ca14146ded06871d7d803414954d3",
      "text": "我很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000013:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:489c015b4e607f3ae765554ca3cf47f268bba73ad7a6b4f98f79b4900d12bcdb",
      "text": "太好了，你能喜欢就好。还有……\n能借此再次传达平时的感谢之情，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ae322374705cafa88df20ae78b6cf4a13feab98d2b114c86e0a2807b5e04800",
      "text": "我一直很感谢制作人哦。\n今天的活动也是这样，还有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb8f641939c083d00a81629673bd4ce7bce8962ddf424462597b4a57667a7cf",
      "text": "多亏了你在练习和工作上的支持，\n我每天才能这么开心地当偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b70d6de759b04946efae36ac1cf36392d25e0e444ee45b1bba42aafbe49e9865",
      "text": "再次谢谢你啊，制作人。\n一直都在身边支持着我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55919eab10229fd7267515a133dab8ce7b144dc2952b8f9bd54563f42f1f321b",
      "text": "为了今后也能回应你的期待，我会竭尽全力\n加油的……今后我们的事，也拜托你啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_304_2_3_004_04_09_a:2_3_004_04_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0cb59ab362daa95320efb75520415201a12f641d669b1423dcf60e1a8d7c7a1",
      "text": "那就这样！\n●●●●プロデューサー也要好好休息哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
